    "# Generate comprehensive report\n",
    "from datetime import datetime\n",
    "\n",
    "report = f\"\"\"\n",
    "# SWOW+KEC+EEG+RT Statistical Analysis Report\n",
    "\n",
    "**Generated:** {datetime.now().strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S')}\n",
    "**Repository:** pcs-meta-repo\n",
    "\n",
    "## Summary\n",
    "\n",
    "### Dataset Overview\n",
    "- **Total Records:** {len(df):,}\n",
    "- **Complete Cases (KEC+RT):** {len(complete_kec_rt):,} ({len(complete_kec_rt)/len(df):.1%})\n",
    "- **Languages:** {df['language'].nunique() if 'language' in df.columns else 'N/A'}\n",
    "- **Datasets:** {df['dataset'].nunique() if 'dataset' in df.columns else 'N/A'}\n",
    "\n",
    "### Variables Analyzed\n",
    "- **KEC Metrics:** {', '.join(available_kec) if available_kec else 'None'}\n",
    "- **Reading Time:** {', '.join(available_rt) if available_rt else 'None'}\n",
    "- **EEG Bands:** {', '.join(available_eeg) if available_eeg else 'None'}\n",
    "\n",
    "### Statistical Results\n",
    "\"\"\"\n",
    "\n",
    "if len(corr_df) > 0:\n",
